exports[`opencode CLI help-text snapshots every documented command emits stable help text: opencode memory --help 1`] = `
"lunos memory

review, search, export, import, migrate, outdate, verify and forget long-term memory

Commands:
  lunos memory list            list remembered facts, with where each came from and their state
  lunos memory show <id>       show one fact and its provenance
  lunos memory search <query>  search memory the way the agent does
  lunos memory forget <id>     remove one fact from memory
  lunos memory outdate <id>    mark a fact as no longer true: kept for history, but no longer
                               recalled
  lunos memory status          show whether memory is on, how many facts are in each state, and any
                               quarantined facts
  lunos memory verify          re-check every ledger entry's integrity hash and the hash chain;
                               quarantined facts are listed
  lunos memory purge           delete all of a memory's stored facts and graph (hand-written notes
                               are kept)
  lunos memory export          export all memory as a versioned bundle (facts, graph, notes,
                               provenance), or as one Markdown file per fact with --format markdown
  lunos memory import <path>   import memory from a Lunos bundle, Markdown, or AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md
                               / Claude Code memory notes; previews first
  lunos memory migrate         move embedded memory into the external database set in
                               memory.backend; previews first

Options:
  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]
      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure        run without external plugins                                           [boolean]"
`;

